1. SCOPE
This license covers:
- The AI-Chain architecture, including block structure, token model (AI, COIN, AIC-LP),
  liquidity logic, fees logic, and chain viewer concepts.
- The VC.ecc module, including eccu.safe, ECCU units, fee split logic (45/42/10/3),
  LICENSE metadata, and fundamental value computation.
- The ECCU-FOND module, including internal ECCU accounting, 2 TB = 1 ECCU value anchor,
  and admin-only reporting.
- The UI/UX concepts for Chain, Wallet, Marketplace, Settings, and Viewer, including
  clickable text links for block details, username-based lookup, and wallet-based lookup.

